    "Ruled out repo-side routing fixes: removing the pin re-opens the fa-m5-2 silent-archive-failure coin flip; fa-m5-2 itself is broken (unverified signing env); hosted-runner migration is a cost/owner decision; the 90m job timeout-minutes is runner-enforced and can never fire for an eaten message",
